      "source": "<a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditingHandler</code></a> extension that uses <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html#isNew(java.lang.Object)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isNew(Object)</code></a> to expose a generic\n<a href=\"../ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html#markAudited(java.lang.Object)\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.markAudited(Object)</code></a> method that will route calls to <a href=\"../ReactiveAuditingHandler.html#markCreated(T)\"><code>ReactiveAuditingHandler.markCreated(Object)</code></a> or\n<a href=\"../ReactiveAuditingHandler.html#markModified(T)\"><code>ReactiveAuditingHandler.markModified(Object)</code></a> based on the <a href=\"../../support/IsNewStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.support\"><code>IsNewStrategy</code></a> determined from the factory.",
      "translation": "扩展了<a href=\"../AuditingHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditingHandler</code></a>，它使用<a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html#isNew(java.lang.Object)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isNew(Object)</code></a>来暴露一个通用的\n<a href=\"../ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.html#markAudited(java.lang.Object)\"><code>ReactiveIsNewAwareAuditingHandler.markAudited(Object)</code></a>方法。该方法将根据工厂确定的<a href=\"../../support/IsNewStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.support\"><code>IsNewStrategy</code></a>，将调用路由到\n<a href=\"../ReactiveAuditingHandler.html#markCreated(T)\"><code>ReactiveAuditingHandler.markCreated(Object)</code></a>或\n<a href=\"../ReactiveAuditingHandler.html#markModified(T)\"><code>ReactiveAuditingHandler.markModified(Object)</code></a>。",
